sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Local UI
    participant TE as Task Engine
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant S as Model Scheduler
    participant EX as Pi Execution
    participant P as Persistence
    participant B as EventBus
    User->>UI: submit task
    UI->>TE: createTask(requestId)
    TE->>P: save task + event atomically
    TE-->>UI: taskId
    TE->>O: dispatch ready task
    O->>S: select ModelRoute
    S-->>O: route / reason
    O->>EX: start AgentRun
    EX-->>B: model/tool/progress events
    User->>UI: stop root task
    UI->>TE: requestStop(requestId)
    TE->>P: persist stop intent
    TE->>O: drain / stop spawning
    O->>EX: stop at safe boundary / abort if necessary
    EX->>P: flush session + execution receipt
    O->>P: persist child settlement
    TE->>P: commit STOPPED state
    TE-->>B: root stopped event
    User->>UI: resume task
    UI->>TE: resumeTask(requestId)
    TE->>P: reconcile interrupted/unknown operations
    TE->>O: schedule eligible work
